      "evidenceText": "Olivia Reingold on X: \"Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really… / X Post Log in Sign up Post Log in Sign up Olivia Reingold on X: \"Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really wearing those items. The observation holds. Here’s the photo I took:\" Conversation Olivia Reingold @Olivia_Reingold Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really wearing those items. The observation holds. Here’s the photo I took: 5:26 PM · Nov 5, 2026 · 1.6M Views 786 311 567 185 Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Relevant people Olivia Reingold @ Olivia_Reingold Follow staff writer @thefp tbt: @politico , @report4america , @columbiajourn What’s happening Show more Olivia Reingold @Olivia_Reingold Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really wearing those items. The observation holds. Here’s the photo I took: 5:26 PM · Nov 5, 2026 · 1.6M Views 786 311 567 185 Olivia Reingold @Olivia_Reingold Nov 5 Here’s another: 96 8 116 223K Mohammad @MargBarAmerica Nov 5 Yes I did break journalism practices by posting a doctored image but you have to keep in mind it was for catty reasons and not actually relevant to anything so you can’t get mad at me. Bari Weiss vouches for me. 3 60 6.4K 110K",
