      "evidenceText": "Advertise with Poynter - Poynter Advertise with Poynter - Poynter DONATE What do you want to search? Submit Sign In | Membership News Training Ethics Fact-Checking Media Literacy AI Events Future of Public Media Newmark Ethics Center IFCN MediaWise PolitiFact Donate About Us Press Freedom Watch The Poynter 50 Podcasts Artificial Intelligence Business & Work Reporting & Editing Fact-Checking Ethics & Trust Local News Journalism, Media & Communication Training Poynter Membership Categories Consulting & Coaching For ACES Members For Local News Funders All Categories Broadcast & Visual Journalism Business & Work Ethics Fact-Checking & Media Literacy Leadership Reporting & Editing Writing Poynter ACES Introductory Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Intermediate Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Advanced Certificate in Editing Workshops and Coaching Tools for Funders Ethics Ethics Training Ethics Articles AI Ethics Public Editor Project Get Ethics Advice Fact-Checking Articles IFCN IFCN Grants International Fact-Checking Day Teen Creator Network PolitiFact MediaWise Media Literacy Resources AI Literacy Ambassadors Teen Creator Network Research & News International en Español MediaWise Training All Events The 2026 Poynter Journalism Prizes Reach your audience through these Poynter channels Poynter.org is a leading news website covering journalism and the news media. Our audience includes journalists and media leaders, journalism educators, students and citizens interested in the news. Let us create a package of run-of-site ads or newsletter sponsorships to get your message to these dedicated journalists, communicators and engaged citizens. Companies can also promote products or services by sponsoring Poynter teaching within our ethics and privacy guidelines. Details below or contact Wendy Wallace at wwallace@poynter.org . Newsletters Poynter, with its fact-checking unit PolitiFact, has multiple distinct newsletters that feature reporting, fact-checking, commentary and resources about the news media from our nonprofit newsrooms. Our targeted, engaged audience includes 250K+ journalists and media leaders, communications and technology professionals, journalism educators, students, fact-checkers and citizens interested in the news media. Sponsor – $$ Sponsored posts available for all Poynter and PolitiFact newsletters, except the Poynter Pro Weekly. One-week minimum for dailies; one-month minimum for weeklies. Subject to availability Includes a headline eight words or less, image of 1020px wide (.jpg or .png), description of 70 words or less, call to action five words or less and hyperlink,​ plus your ​clickable logo​ at the bottom of the newsletter. Logo should be horizontal, high-resolution .png file Reserve now ➡️ Partner – $$$ Available for The Poynter Report and Open Tabs 6-month minimum investment, highest visibility Please inquire Learn more about our newsletters and sponsorship options ➡️ . PolitiFact.com advertising options Poynter is the home of the Pulitzer Prize-winning PolitiFact website and its newsletters (see above). The site had 27 million pageviews in 2023. Website ads are $6 CPM, available sizes 300×250, 320×50 and 300×600. Native advertising opportunities are also available. Poynter.org advertising options Analytics and demographics (November 2024 through October 2025) Users: 3.6 million over 12 months, with a monthly average of 463,000 Location: U.S. 72%, Canada 4%, UK 4%. Other countries 3% or less Gender: 52% male, 48% female Age: Largest audience segment is 18-24 Pageviews: 5.6 million, with a monthly average of 460,000 Interests: News & politics/avid news readers ROS display ads Advertising rates start at $5 per 1,000 impressions (CPM). ​Suggested buy: $1,000 for 200,000 impressions per month. Ad sizes: Please provide 970×250 (a top performer), 320×50, 728×90, 300×250 (72 dpi). Please provide all sizes​ to reach both desktop and mobile. Ads must be JPGs, not PDFs. Sponsored content ​Publish your article targeted to Poynter’s audience on ​poynter.org​. Includes lead image, author profile, article with links and position on home page for 24 hours, findable by search and direct link for 12 months. Poynter’s marketing staff will consult with you to edit a story you write ( here’s an example ). Length: 500-800 words. The article will be labeled as sponsored content in a subhead, in keeping with our ethics and transparency policies. We will promote it with one post from Poynter’s Facebook account and two posts from Poynter’s X account. $1,850 Media Job Board The Media Job Board is Poynter’s employment website in partnership with Editor & Publisher and America’s Newspapers. To post job openings, click here. Sponsor Poynter teaching By sponsoring a Poynter workshop or online course, your brand and message will reach an engaged, targeted audience. Poynter retains control over all teaching, per our ethics policy. Pricing varies based on benefits received — ask for details. For detailed information, including rates and availability, or to have a custom media plan developed, please email advertising@poynter.org",
