      "title": "It’s been a great year for investigative reporting. But there’s a catch.",
      "url": "https://www.poynter.org/commentary/2026/2026-midterms-democratic-sweep-election-night-media-coverage",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-18T07:07:48.587Z",
